Title: Chapter 7: What the Meditators Knew
Creation-Date: 2026-07-10
Last-Modified: 2026-10-04
Output-Formats: 
Tagline: The metacognitive layer that makes the return to sources productive rather than mechanical. Hitbonenut, vipassana, theoria, muraqaba, different names for the same practice. Plus the limit of calibration, which is a reading taken inside the instrument's range, and the router that has to run before the work rather than after it. Self-monitoring is the mentalizing organ turned around, which makes it recursive, and recursion loses resolution at every level the way detail falls off toward the horizon. That is not a defect, because full-precision recursion is prohibitively expensive and nothing that works has ever paid for it. The failure mode is not shallow recursion but unanchored recursion, which is Narcissus.
